[en.DECISION_CATEGORY_C12_PROVISIONAL_CONSOLIDATION]
Promote Friendship with the Apple Family

[en.DECISION_CATEGORY_C12_PROVISIONAL_CONSOLIDATION_desc]
The relationship between the Pie family and the Apple family is growing increasingly close. In anticipation of potential threats in the future, both families are planning the merger of their respective territories to become a powerful nation. (Note: This is a temporary resolution to temporarily propose the merger with Appleloosa. Please stay tuned for updates on the second phase of the rock farm’s national policy.)

[zh.DECISION_CATEGORY_C12_PROVISIONAL_CONSOLIDATION]
促进与苹果家族的友谊

[zh.DECISION_CATEGORY_C12_PROVISIONAL_CONSOLIDATION_desc]
派家族与苹果家族的关系日益亲密，为了应对未来可能到来的威胁，俩家族正在筹划各自管辖地区的合并来成为一个强大的国家，不过，在此之前，我们需要确保俩地的小马都认同这个主意。
